WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.831
The Celtic Cross is a ten-card tarot spread that
looks at one situation from many sides.

00:00:06.831 --> 00:00:09.966
Here is how the cross and the staff fit
together.

00:00:11.266 --> 00:00:12.696
The shape of the spread.

00:00:12.696 --> 00:00:14.185
The layout has two parts.

00:00:14.185 --> 00:00:16.270
Six cards form a cross on the left.

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:19.010
Four cards form a vertical staff on the
right.

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:21.720
What the two halves do.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:29.017
A helpful way to think about it: the cross describes the
situation, and the staff describes you and what surrounds you.

00:00:30.417 --> 00:00:32.779
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:32.779 --> 00:00:37.569
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
